 "description": "<p>Get primary and secondary data from the opencare project.</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>Primary data&nbsp;</strong>refer to the online conversation (posts and comments).</li>\n\t<li><strong>Secondary data</strong>&nbsp;refer to the ethnographic work done on the primary data (annotations and codes, or tags).</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>You can also access these data through APIs, though you will need to ask for a key.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/opencarecc/opencare-data-documentation.\">Learn more&nbsp;on data in opencare</a></li>\n\t<li>APIs documentation <a href=\"https://edgeryders.eu/t/using-the-edgeryders-eu-apis/7904\">is here</a></li>\n</ul>",
